{
  "id": 8867094200519,
  "title": "Dragonfly Patchwork Pattern Quilt Set, Animal Style, Dragonfly Quilt",
  "handle": "dragonfly-patchwork-pattern-quilt-set-animal-style-dragonfly-quilt",
  "body_html": "<p>Embrace rustic charm and comfort with this beautiful Dragonfly Patchwork Quilt Set from Jeminise. Featuring classic patterns and soft fabrics, this quilt set brings a cozy, timeless look to any bedroom, making it a perfect addition for warmth and tradition. Personalize it with your name or add extra pillowcases for a unique touch.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Rustic Farmhouse Design:</strong> Adorn your bedroom with the countryside charm of a dragonfly patchwork pattern, offering a cozy and traditional aesthetic.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Customization:</strong> Customize your quilt set by adding your name or opting for additional pillowcases to make it uniquely yours.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available in Multiple Sizes:</strong> Choose from Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68''x86''), Full (80''x90''), Queen (90''x90''), and King (102''x91'') to perfectly fit your bed.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift Idea:</strong> An excellent gift for Christmas, New Year, holidays, anniversaries, or birthdays for family members and loved ones.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> This microfiber quilt set is machine washable; simply wash separately in cold water and air dry for lasting fluffiness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Each set includes 1 Quilt, with an option to add 2 Pillowcases.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Crafted from soft and durable polycotton fabric for comfortable use.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Dragonfly</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Patchwork Style Pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Farmhouse Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Dragonfly</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + 2 Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68''x86''), Full (80''x90''), Queen (90''x90''), King (102''x91'')</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
